-- Did not pay the fee.
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I done what section 266(c)(6) requires of a plaintiff (s 266(c)(6))` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- If I prevail.
#ASSERT `Will the fee I pay the Secretary of State on a converted corporation be taxed as costs (s 266(c)(6))` TRUE
-- Fifth anniversary still inside the period.
