-- Incorporated on 1 August 2022: not "before".
#ASSERT NOT (`Does a restriction on mergers in my certificate or agreement apply to a conversion (s 266(k))` `a provision of the certificate of incorporation under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) (YearMonthDay 2022 1 1) TRUE FALSE)
