#ASSERT `Does a restriction on mergers in my certificate or agreement apply to a conversion (s 266(k))` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 8 1) TRUE FALSE
-- In effect only from 2 August 2022.
#ASSERT NOT (`Does a restriction on mergers in my certificate or agreement apply to a conversion (s 266(k))` `a provision in a voting trust agreement or other written agreement between the corporation and 1 or more of its stockholders under s 266(k)` (YearMonthDay 2020 5 5) (YearMonthDay 2022 8 2) TRUE FALSE)
