#ASSERT `Can the terms of the merger make me a general partner (s 267(a))` TRUE `entity that is a general partnership`
-- Not a partnership.
#ASSERT `Can the terms of the merger make me a general partner (s 267(a))` FALSE `entity that is a limited liability company`
